{"additions":3827,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nCloses #170.\n\n- **`core::gh_fixture`** — with `VIG_GH_FIXTURE=<dir>` (recording-only, undocumented for users, same standing as `VIG_PROCS_ROOT_PID`) every `gh` invocation in `run_gh` returns the file named after its arguments from `<dir>` instead of running `gh`; a missing file is a loud error so a demo never half-works, `gh auth status` passes when the directory exists, and the disk caches are bypassed so a recording always starts from the fixture state. GraphQL query text is replaced by a short tag in the file name (`query-project-meta`, `query-pr-stacks`, …); everything else is sanitised and deterministic.\n- **`vig fixtures record <dir>`** (hidden subcommand, `src/fixtures.rs`) runs the GitHub and Projects pages' real commands — issue / PR lists and details, PR stacks, runs plus the first three runs' jobs and logs, linked projects, the viewer login, each board over the GraphQL path and its items' details — teeing every response into `<dir>`. `mise run fixtures:refresh` wraps it and is the only step of the demo pipeline that touches the API. The whitespace pre-commit fixers skip `tape/fixtures/` so recordings stay byte-exact.\n- **Tapes** — `demo-github-issue`, `demo-github-pr` and `demo-projects` replay `tape/fixtures/` through `VIG_GH_FIXTURE` set by their mise tasks; `Require gh` and the cache-wiping line go away. `mise run demo:all` no longer needs the network or spends points.\n- **Integration tests** — `page_loads_a_board_from_recorded_fixtures` (Projects: linked projects → board via GraphQL → views, rendered with `TestBackend`) and `page_loads_lists_from_recorded_fixtures` (GitHub: issues and runs load and render) run against the same recordings, skipping when `tape/fixtures` is absent (packaged sources).\n- `CLAUDE.md`'s demo checklist explains the mechanism for contributors.\n\n## Demo\n\n`demo-github-issue.gif` and `demo-projects.gif` are re-recorded from the fixtures (same content, zero API calls). The PR demo follows in a commit on this branch: the fixtures are refreshed once this PR exists so the recorded PR list is not empty, then `demo-github-pr` is re-recorded from them.\n\n## Tests\n\nFixture naming / replay unit tests plus the two page-level integration tests. 394 tests green, clippy clean.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w","changedFiles":44,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-08T10:13:05Z","deletions":19,"headRefName":"feat/gh-fixtures","labels":[],"number":174,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[],"state":"OPEN","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","conclusion":"","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34214261508/job/102022185694","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T10:13:12Z","status":"IN_PROGRESS","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T10:13:48Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34214261426/job/102022185113","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-08T10:13:13Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","conclusion":"","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34214261508/job/102022185551","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T10:13:15Z","status":"IN_PROGRESS","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","conclusion":"","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34214261508/job/102022185641","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T10:13:18Z","status":"IN_PROGRESS","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","conclusion":"","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34214261426/job/102022185338","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T10:13:11Z","status":"IN_PROGRESS","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","conclusion":"","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34214261426/job/102022185353","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T10:13:19Z","status":"IN_PROGRESS","workflowName":"CI"}],"title":"🧪 Record and replay gh output for API-free demos and integration tests"}
